{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16795","headline":"杂言奉和圣制至承光院见自生藤感其得地因以成咏应制 · 崔元翰","name":"杂言奉和圣制至承光院见自生藤感其得地因以成咏应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"新藤正可翫，得地又逢时。\n罗生密叶交绿蔓，欲布清阴垂紫蕤。\n已带朝光暖，犹含轻露滋。\n遥依千华殿，稍上万年枝。\n余芳连桂树，积润傍莲池。\n岂如幽谷无人见，空覆荒榛杂兔丝。\n圣心对此应有感，隐迹如斯谁复知。\n怀贤劳永叹，比物赋新诗。\n聘丘园，访茅茨。\n爲谢中林士，王道本无私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔元翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}